## Factor Screening Summary — Cycle 2026-11-05 (visible cutoff 2026-11-04)

### Market Assessment
- **Overall trend: Sideways** — cross-asset 20d drift ratio = 0.040 (mean daily ret +0.017%, vol 0.435%), well below the 0.25 bull threshold and above −0.25 bear.
- **Trend strength: Weak** — 60d cross-asset drift still positive (+6.2% mean) but 20d momentum has flattened; broad indices mixed (NDX +6.2%, SOX **−23.6%**, SPX −6.6%, ETH **+35.7%**, WTI +12.3% over 20d).
- **Risk level: Medium-High** — cross-sectional 20d dispersion is **12.9%** (elevated); sharp rotation regime with violent reversals (SOX swung from +18.6% → −23.6% in ~2 weeks).
- **Volatility regime: Very low / complacent** — VIX at **9.0** (down from 27.9 60d ago, 13.6 20d ago). Extreme-low VIX implies asymmetric tail risk (VIX spike potential).
- **Liquidity/correlation:** Fully invested, no cash sleeve; dispersion is high so cross-sectional signals retain power, but momentum is whipsawing in the rotation.

### Available Factors (active library, 4 validated EFFECTIVE)
| Category | Factor | IC | ICIR | q=abs(IC·ICIR) | Dir |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Momentum (short) | `mom_10d_skip5` | 0.0409 | 0.1183 | 0.00484 | +1 |
| Momentum (long) | `mom_120d_skip5` | 0.0521 | 0.1381 | 0.00720 | +1 |
| Sentiment/Risk (defensive) | `vix_beta_cond_60x20` | −0.0382 | −0.0927 | 0.00354 | −1 |
| Low-Risk/Vol | `vol_of_vol20x60` | 0.0424 | 0.1206 | 0.00511 | +1 |

### Selected Factors & Ensemble (4/4, no new admissions this cycle)
| Factor | Weight | Direction | Suitability rationale |
|---|---|---|---|
| `mom_120d_skip5` | **0.28** | +1 | Highest quality (ICIR 0.138, hit 0.56); trimmed from 0.348 because live feedback flags momentum decay in the rotation regime |
| `vol_of_vol20x60` | **0.28** | +1 | Boosted from 0.247 — low-correlation diversifier (max |corr| 0.11), favored when VIX is compressed at 9.0 |
| `mom_10d_skip5` | **0.22** | +1 | Kept for short-horizon rotation capture; slightly trimmed (high turnover rank 4.09) |
| `vix_beta_cond_60x20` | **0.22** | −1 | Boosted from 0.171 — defensive tail hedge; critical given VIX at multi-year lows and asymmetric spike risk |

Weights sum to **1.00**; directions preserve sign(IC); method `quality_ic_tilt` with a modest regime tilt (momentum block 0.58 → 0.50, defensive/vol block 0.42 → 0.50) per live feedback. Persisted to both `factor_ensemble.json` and `factors/factor_ensemble.json` (strategy.py loads dynamically via `load_ensemble()`; no code change needed).

### Risk Notes
