- **Turnover:** mom_10d has 10d rank turnover 4.09; at 3bps one-way friction this is the costliest factor — weight held at 0.22.
- **Tail risk:** VIX 9.0 is an extreme; `vix_beta_cond_60x20` (dir −1) is the explicit protection and is deliberately overweighted vs its pure-q weight (0.171).
- **Execution:** all 15 assets tradable; fractional quantities; no liquidity flags beyond crypto vol.

